:"其後五年，而吳王聞齊景公死而大臣爭寵，新君弱，乃興師北伐齊。伍子胥諫曰：「句踐食不重味，弔死問疾，且欲有所用之也。此人不死，必為吳患。今吳之有越，猶人之有腹心疾也。而王不先越而乃務齊，不亦謬乎！」吳王不聽，伐齊，大敗齊師於艾陵，遂威鄒魯之君以歸。益疏子胥之謀。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m017-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m017-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"齊景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003844","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m017-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"大臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或未定指代，未補姓名及成員；鮑氏不直接等同鮑牧。"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m017-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"新君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或未定指代，未補姓名及成員；鮑氏不直接等同鮑牧。"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m017-0030","start":30,"end":33,"surface":"伍子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003808","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m017-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"句踐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003842","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m017-0083","start":83,"end":84,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m017-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m017-0116","start":116,"end":120,"surface":"鄒魯之君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或未定指代，未補姓名及成員；鮑氏不直接等同鮑牧。"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m017-0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003808","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu","book_id":"b-shiji-066","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-066-wu"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p018","text":"其後四年，吳王將北伐齊，越王句踐用子貢之謀，乃率其眾以助吳，而重寶以獻遺太宰嚭。太宰嚭既數受越賂，其愛信越殊甚，日夜為言於吳王。吳王信用嚭之計。伍子胥諫曰：「夫越，腹心之病，今信其浮辭詐偽而貪齊。破齊，譬猶石田，無所用之。且盤庚之誥曰：『有顛越不恭，劓殄滅之，俾無遺育，無使易種于茲邑。』此商之所以興。願王釋齊而先越；若不然，後將悔之無及。」而吳王不聽，使子胥於齊。子胥臨行，謂其子曰：「吾數諫王，王不用，吾今見吳之亡矣。汝與吳俱亡，無益也。」乃屬其子於齊鮑牧，而還報吳。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0012","start":12,"end":16,"surface":"越王句踐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003842","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"子貢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003845","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"其眾","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或未定指代，未補姓名及成員；鮑氏不直接等同鮑牧。"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0036","start":36,"end":39,"surface":"太宰嚭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003831","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0040","start":40,"end":43,"surface":"太宰嚭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003831","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"嚭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003831","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0072","start":72,"end":75,"surface":"伍子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003808","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0112","start":112,"end":114,"surface":"盤庚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003846","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0152","start":152,"end":153,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0172","start":172,"end":174,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0178","start":178,"end":180,"surface":"子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003808","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0183","start":183,"end":185,"surface":"子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003808","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0190","start":190,"end":191,"surface":"子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003860","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0197","start":197,"end":198,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0199","start":199,"end":200,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0225","start":225,"end":226,"surface":"子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003860","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m018-0227","start":227,"end":230,"surface":"齊鮑牧","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003847","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu","book_id":"b-shiji-066","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-066-wu"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p020","text":"吳王既誅伍子胥，遂伐齊。齊鮑氏殺其君悼公而立陽生。吳王欲討其賊，不勝而去。其後二年，吳王召魯衛之君會之橐皋。其明年，因北大會諸侯於黃池，以令周室。越王句踐襲殺吳太子，破吳兵。吳王聞之，乃歸，使使厚幣與越平。後九年，越王句踐遂滅吳，殺王夫差；而誅太宰嚭，以不忠於其君，而外受重賂，與己比周也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003840","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"伍子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003808","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"齊鮑氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或未定指代，未補姓名及成員；鮑氏不直接等同鮑牧。"},{"